  "content": "<p align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pla_is_me\" title=\"YouTube\">\n    <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811663/youtube_icon_bcbanf.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/EsvPsnqJpz\" title=\"Discord\">\n    <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811736/discord_icon_bg_rp4omx.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/pla_is_me\" title=\"Ko‑fi\">\n    <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761815764/kofi_icon_bg_sy3foi.png\" alt=\"Ko‑fi\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/PlaIsMe\" title=\"github\">\n    <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811682/github_icon_bg_wmtjei.png\" alt=\"Github\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"color:#fc0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center\">⚠️<strong>此模組僅限客戶端使用</strong></a></p>\n\n感謝 [@thebusdriver](https://www.curseforge.com/members/thebusdriver/projects)，他創建了原始程式碼和第一個儲存庫：[epicfight-x-phys-tweaks](https://github.com/Mactott/epicfight-x-phys-tweaks)。此專案已由我接手並維護，並獲得 [@thebusdriver](https://www.curseforge.com/members/thebusdriver/projects) 的許可。\n\n本模組為 Epic Fight 與 Physics 模組之間增加了生物布娃娃物理的相容性。\n\n內附設定檔，可將任何不應被設定為布娃娃的實體加入黑名單。",
